# Session lifecycle of one mechanic: validate, refresh (rotated cookie set), rejected cookies, logout (every cookie cleared).
# Replaying cookies that were already issued (after logout, after a rotation) is refresh-reuse-check.py. Self-provisions/deletes its mechanic.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@MatrixRunSuffix = {{$timestamp}}
@MatrixEmailWithPhone = session.lifecycle.{{MatrixRunSuffix}}@example.test


### [Setup][Auth] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Admin Session] Login as admin to provision the session-lifecycle mechanic (200 expected)
# @name Login
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Register] Throwaway mechanic for the session-lifecycle chain (200 expected)
# @name regSessionMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Session", "lastName": "Lifecycle", "email": "{{MatrixEmailWithPhone}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Admin Session] Logout admin before the session-lifecycle chain (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Session] Validate without any cookie (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Session] Validate with a malformed access cookie (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate
Cookie: __Host-arsm-access-token=not-a-jwt

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Session] Refresh without any cookie is refused by the handler, not by the Origin/CSRF layers (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Session] Refresh with an unknown refresh token and a matching CSRF pair (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Cookie: __Host-arsm-refresh-token=unknown-refresh-token; __Host-arsm-csrf-token=unknown-csrf-pair
X-CSRF-Token: unknown-csrf-pair

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Session] Logout without any cookie (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Positive][Session] Login before the validate/refresh/logout chain (200 expected, mustChangePassword false)
# @name Login
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{MatrixEmailWithPhone}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == false
?? js (response.parsedBody.personId == regSessionMechanic.personId) == true

###

### [Positive][Session] Validate returns the session facts of the signed-in mechanic (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.personId == regSessionMechanic.personId) == true
?? js response.parsedBody.isAdmin == false
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == false

###

### [Positive][Session] Refresh rotates the session: 204 with a fresh access, refresh and CSRF cookie (204 expected)
# @name Refresh
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 204
?? js (["__Host-arsm-access-token=","__Host-arsm-refresh-token=","__Host-arsm-csrf-token="].every(n => response.headers['set-cookie'].some(c => c.startsWith(n) && !c.startsWith(n + ";")))) == true

###

# Refresh rotates the CSRF cookie too, so the requests below need the new value.

### [Positive][Session] The rotated session validates (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.personId == regSessionMechanic.personId) == true

###

### [Manual][Session] Rate limits: login 10/min and refresh 20/min per client (429), not run to keep the suite out of the 3-minute ban
# Manual: the login route answers login_rate_limited, then login_banned for 3 minutes; Development raises login to 300/min.

###

### [Positive][Session] Logout answers 204 and expires all six session cookies, legacy names included (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
?? js (["__Host-arsm-access-token","__Host-arsm-refresh-token","__Host-arsm-csrf-token","__Host-autoservice_at","__Host-autoservice_rt","__Host-autoservice_csrf"].every(n => response.headers['set-cookie'].some(c => c.startsWith(n + "=;") && c.toLowerCase().includes("expires=thu, 01 jan 1970")))) == true

###

### [Negative][Session] Validate after logout (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 401

###

### [Setup][Cleanup] Login as admin again to delete the throwaway mechanic (200 expected)
# @name Login
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Cleanup] Delete the session-lifecycle mechanic (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{regSessionMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
